{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "vendor_version": "1.19.26",
  "notes": [
    "Hand-maintained from the wrapper registry and vendor_arguments; raw passthrough has no fixed flag contract.",
    "Null means the vendor help states no default; it does not assert an API default.",
    "Parse --only-main-content states false in CLI help; the API-side default is true.",
    "The injection check is unavailable through vendor CLI 1.19.26, as recorded by the wrapper; there is no exposed flag or stated default to compare.",
    "Agent --max-credits is forwarded when supplied; its API default is not stated in CLI help. Model routing is not a help-text default.",
    "search --categories developer is answered by the API directly (firecrawl/cli#222); the verb map lists only flags the vendor help states.",
    "gov and developer are API-direct wrapper verbs (POST /v2/search/gov and /v2/search/developer); the vendor's own gov and developer commands exist only from 1.26.x and are not in this map."
  ],
